      "from": "P",
      "to": "LS",
      "variant": "dashed"
    }
  ],
  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Sample connections and roles",
      "items": [
        "The host uses HTTP on Api A and STREAM on Play A. The guest and observer connect to Api B and Play B.",
        "Play A/B also act as session nodes. They are manual RouteMesh peers and use the separate tictactoe.api ClientServer channel to request authentication.",
        "The Location Store records the current owner for RoomId and ActorId.",
        "The play node is the Client that requests authentication from the api node, the Server on the tictactoe.api ClientServer Channel."
      ]
    }
  ]
